WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.467
Using REau every day, with the bike and the dash

2
00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:07.067
1. Turn the bike on, open REau and tap Turn on

3
00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:14.733
REau takes you to Android Auto: in the three-dot menu, tap Start head unit server and go back to REau

4
00:00:14.733 --> 00:00:22.133
With Android Auto Active and the dash Ready, REau shows Streaming. Put the phone away, even with the screen off

5
00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:28.667
2. With the bike stopped, set the destination in the Waze app, by voice or on the Android Auto screen

6
00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:35.267
3. On the Android Auto screen, tap and drag the picture to use Android Auto as in a car

7
00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:42.000
If Google Maps or the app menu opens, pick Waze. After using it once, it tends to open straight away

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.133
4. Joystick, map mode: left zooms out, right zooms in, up is the dash’s back and center opens media control

9
00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:58.200
In media control: left and right move through the items, up opens the app menu, down calls Gemini and center confirms

10
00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:04.467
With Spotify on screen and playing, left and right change the song and center plays or pauses

11
00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:11.267
5. Call ringing: left answers, right and center decline. Up and down do nothing

12
00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:17.733
On a call: right raises the volume, left lowers it, up and down do nothing and center ends the call

13
00:01:17.733 --> 00:01:26.133
At the top of the dash’s picture you see who is calling and the volume. At the loudest level, a tap shows Call eight of eight again

14
00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:32.667
6. The info ring shows, one at a time, rain, wind, sun and the phone’s battery

15
00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:38.000
Each piece of information stays at least seven seconds: the time goes from seven to thirty

16
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:45.733
Or, with Info in the title, they go in the gold band’s title. With a route: twenty seconds of street and seven of information

17
00:01:45.733 --> 00:01:51.867
With the phone’s screen locked, the dash carries on as usual; only the preview inside the app stops

18
00:01:51.867 --> 00:01:59.933
7. If the dash’s Wi-Fi drops, REau warns you and comes back by itself when the network returns. When you switch the bike off, that is normal

19
00:01:59.933 --> 00:02:04.533
8. To stop, tap Turn off in the app or in the notification

20
00:02:04.533 --> 00:02:08.133
Ride safe. On the road, eyes stay on the road

